  "description": {
    "text": "A box sold in Europe: first announced for Germany on 23 August 2024, with English boxes in the Netherlands and the United Kingdom from mid to late September 2024. It held Paradox Rift's Aegislash ex at regular size and as a jumbo, cosmos holofoil copies of Honedge and Doublade, found in no booster pack, four booster packs and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live. It was one of several retailer-exclusive boxes of late 2024, in the same packaging, that reprinted Pokémon ex from early Scarlet & Violet expansions.",
